# Walkthrough - Shadcn/UI Components & Build Fix

Generated and installed the full set of 46 standard shadcn/ui components in `app/frontend/src/components/ui/`, provided the necessary `cn` utility in `src/lib/utils.js`, added toast notification hooks, integrated theme tokens in `src/index.css`, and verified that the React frontend compiles cleanly.

## Changes Made

### Core Utilities & Hooks
- Created [utils.js](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/Namest/app/frontend/src/lib/utils.js):
  - Defined `cn(...)` using `clsx` and `tailwind-merge`.
- Created [use-toast.js](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/Namest/app/frontend/src/hooks/use-toast.js) and [use-toast.js](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/Namest/app/frontend/src/components/ui/use-toast.js):
  - Radix-based toast state machine, reducer, and event dispatcher.

### Theme & Styling
- Updated [index.css](file:///c:/Users/lenovo/OneDrive/Desktop/Namest/app/frontend/src/index.css):
  - Added `@layer base` CSS variables for `--background`, `--foreground`, `--card`, `--primary`, `--border`, etc. mapped to `tailwind.config.js`.

